  "label": "Child Waiting Meme Stereotype",
  "description": "The image of a child with a pensive or resigned expression, hands under chin, waiting passively, is a widely recognized internet meme format. This format is used humorously to represent someone choosing to wait rather than engage further, often in situations where the person is frustrated, bored, or has given up on a conversation or task. The meme relies on the viewer's familiarity with this specific visual trope and its associated humorous context.",
